# Only the built lesson needs to reach the CDN. Everything else in this repo is authoring
# material: the build script and its specs, the SME decks, the engine sources the bundle is
# generated FROM, and the review screenshots. Left in, they would all be publicly fetchable at
# their paths, and the review shots alone are tens of megabytes of dead weight on every deploy.
#
# 3_CURRENT_BUILD/_review_shots is excluded for the same reason - it ships nothing the game loads.
# vercel.json's rewrites point at 3_CURRENT_BUILD, which stays.

1_SPEC/
2_MOCKUPS/
4_ENGINE/
5_CURRENT_BUILD_SCREENSHOTS/
3_CURRENT_BUILD/_review_shots/

*.pptx
CHANGES.md
README.md

.git/
